        "y0": 0.7478753954473167,
        "x1": 0.7931339787501915,
        "y1": 0.7604544861148101
      },
      "text": "Thus, reasoning about ϕ reduces to reasoning about formulas with at most three",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2070580027461831,
        "y0": 0.7628750162895279,
        "x1": 0.7039194792703866,
        "y1": 0.7754541069570213
      },
      "text": "atomic components. In (†), M is the clause set encoding ϕ and g = ϕ",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
